      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "When halbrux uses her revelation spells, her mind fills with a flood of disorienting information. The first time Halbrux casts one of her revelation spells in a day, she takes a –4 penalty to initiative rolls until the next time she makes her daily preparations. The second time Halbrux casts one of her revelation spells in a day, she is also flat-footed until the next time she makes her daily preparations."
      ]
